### VISITS ENPOINTS

GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/visits
Content-Type: application/json


### Register entry by PersonId
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/visits/entry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personId": "CC308B75-CC20-49A3-8E86-EE7D4D2C1F5E",
  "entryTime": null
}


### Register entry by Code
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/visits/entry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "789012",
  "entryTime": null
}


### Get All Active Visits
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/visits/active
Accept: application/json


### Get Visit History by Person
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/visits/person/cc308b75-cc20-49a3-8e86-ee7d4d2c1f5e
Accept: application/json

